# Ignore rules for this suite's image build only.
#
# BuildKit reads `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` beside the Dockerfile in preference
# to the context root's `.dockerignore`, which is what lets one suite widen its
# context to compat/ (run.sh says why) without every other suite's build
# inheriting rules written for this one.
#
# Everything the build needs is named in the Dockerfile's COPY lines; what is
# excluded here is the build output and dependency trees a developer's checkout
# accumulates, which would otherwise be sent to the daemon on every build.
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
**/target
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
suites/go-sdk/vendor
ui/dist
